     * (tooltip) and small markers such as badges (small); the step between
     * staggered items (at most six, first render only), the delays before
     * loading indicators may show (fast loads show nothing; js/motion.js
     * LOADER_DELAY_MS mirrors --ds-delay-loader), how long a loader that
     * showed stays at least (LOADER_MIN_VISIBLE_MS mirrors --ds-hold-loader),
     * how long a button shows its success face (DS.motion.busy()) and the
     * tooltip delays of DS.overlay.tooltips(): the wait before one shows,
     * the window after a hide in which the next shows at once (warm-up) and
     * the grace before one hides, so the pointer can move onto it
