     a tag; the trailing one also a button, which keeps its pointer. Prefix
     and suffix hold text that belongs to the value (https://, GB), aria-hidden,
     so the unit belongs in the label too. */
  .ds-input-group__leading,
  .ds-input-group__trailing {
